logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Testes, Cobertura e Relatórios E2E
coverage/
.nyc_output/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
